            "review_text": "旅のホルマリン漬け\nSaitama, Japan13278 contributions\n3\nUse the leftover dong at the airport cafe before leaving early in the morning\nJan 2024 • Couples\nA cafe in Tan Son Nhat Airport, Ho Chi Minh City. I visited here early in the morning to have a light breakfast before leaving Vietnam. First of all, the price is definitely higher than cafes in downtown Ho Chi Minh City, since it's in the airport. Americano, banh mi, the taste of the Americano is normal. The banh mi... disappointing. It's for a break in the airport! I used up all my remaining Vietnamese dong.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten April 13, 2024",
